55, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-04/26372_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3622.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">名古屋飯沢山食べれて幸せでした✌🏻</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">see you later ✩*.ﾟ#62</span></p></div>\n                    ",
